{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"10503","self":"https://simeoncalixte1990.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10503","key":"AIN-180","fields":{"summary":"[Submissions] Adopt shared Constants contracts in API and UI","description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue after AIN-179: consume registry Constants 0.1.2 in EnsuredAPI and EnsuredUI; replace duplicate manual field, condition and section contracts with shared types; reuse condition semantics while preserving supported form behavior."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Acceptance: generate API runtime validation from the shared contract, reject unsupported operators/types and missing metadata; preserve zero/false defaults, repeated-row isolation, conditional required fields, nested coverages and submitted payloads; verify manual unit and isolated database tests plus UI component tests/build. Preserve pre-existing API file relocation changes outside delivery commits."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Release gates: final typecheck, ESLint and Prettier in each affected package before merge. Baseline UI tsc currently reports 217 errors and lacks ESLint/Prettier scripts; record and resolve or explicitly block UI merge on those gaps, without claiming scoped checks prove package readiness. No visual or supported interaction change intended; no deployment/migration. Broader board DTO/artifact/seed refactors are separate review recommendations. AIN-179 is the required completed package prerequisite; unrelated historical release/finance work is excluded."}]}]},"issuelinks":[{"id":"10377","self":"https://simeoncalixte1990.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issueLink/10377","type":{"id":"10000","name":"Blocks","inward":"is blocked by","outward":"blocks","self":"https://simeoncalixte1990.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issueLinkType/10000"},"inwardIssue":{"id":"10502","